    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d735">

                <pb facs="0973" n="867" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg867"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador of
                        Austria-Hungary.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-10-22"><hi rendition="#italic">October 22,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Ambassador</hi>: Will you, as dean of the
                    diplomatic corps, be so kind as to name the honorary pallbearers to act at the
                    funeral of the late Don Jorge Muñoz, minister from Guatemala?</p>
                <p>The funeral will take place at 10 o’clock a.m. on Wednesday, the 24th instant, at
                    St. Matthew’s Church</p>
                <p>Faithfully, yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Bacon.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
